  "id": "choking-under-pressure",
  "term": "choking under pressure",
  "definition": "Choking under pressure is a drop in performance when a person faces competitive or evaluative pressure and performs worse than expected. In sport, it is described as arising when attention is pulled away from the task or becomes overly focused on the mechanics of the action.",
